00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:34.292
♪ Shakin', sugar, sugar! ♪

00:21:34.292 --> 00:21:36.208
♪ Shakin', sugar, sugar! ♪

00:21:37.375 --> 00:21:39.667
♪ Shake it love, YES! ♪

00:21:56.625 --> 00:22:03.708
<i>Feelings that won't stop,</i>
<i>thoughts that won't stop</i>

00:22:03.708 --> 00:22:10.792
<i>Our hearts are always within us</i>

00:22:10.792 --> 00:22:17.917
<i>Lightly beating a rhythm every day</i>

00:22:17.917 --> 00:22:24.208
<i>I want to talk to you right now</i>

00:22:24.208 --> 00:22:28.417
<i>Even if nothing special has happened</i>

00:22:28.417 --> 00:22:32.000
<i>It's fine if we can just laugh</i>

00:22:32.000 --> 00:22:39.250
<i>As long as this moment keeps making us happy</i>

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:42.125
<i>amor, amor, I'll be by your side</i>

00:22:42.125 --> 00:22:46.250
<i>I can hear the beating of your heart</i>

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:53.458
<i>I will always connect to you, over and over</i>

00:22:53.458 --> 00:22:56.458
<i>amor, amor, the feelings there</i>

00:22:56.458 --> 00:23:00.458
<i>that you want to hold dear</i>

00:23:00.458 --> 00:23:09.583
<i>Please tell me with your voice someday</i>

00:23:11.917 --> 00:23:13.042
"On a New Path"

00:23:13.042 --> 00:23:15.083
"On a New Path"
I'm Arata Uduki.

00:23:15.083 --> 00:23:17.292
"On a New Path"
Aoi and I, and You and Yoru are going

00:23:17.292 --> 00:23:19.542
"On a New Path"
to be in a play for the first time.

00:23:19.542 --> 00:23:22.958
"On a New Path"
Well, I'm doing my best at rehearsals,

00:23:22.958 --> 00:23:27.500
but an experienced actor named Mikaduki
has some pretty harsh things to say.

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:32.583
Hm? Aoi, are you all right?

00:23:32.583 --> 00:23:35.375
Next time, "On a New Path."

00:23:35.375 --> 00:23:38.375
Even so, we have no choice but to do it

00:23:38.375 --> 00:23:42.059
because we were chosen.
